; claude: the live blocks of a playable voice (plan_synth_teaching.md,
; notes_synth.md): the oscillator run block after block (Vco), the
; modulators (Lfo, Drift), the keys to a voice (Voicing), the filters a
; synthesizer moves all the time (Moog_ladder, Svf). What a voice is
; made of, not a voice: the instruments themselves are the apps' (a
; Minimoog is apps/music's), and the interface they play through,
; Instrument.mli, is audio/'s, since its Mixer holds them. On signal/
; and synthesis/ only. In the package
; tiny_libs, as tiny_libs.audio_instruments: pure OCaml, so the web
; backend has it too.
(library
 (name audio_instruments)
 (public_name tiny_libs.audio_instruments)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries audio_signal audio_synthesis)
)
